deep state assassination attempt.

00:03:04.180 --> 00:03:09.290
You're always saying that when the right is
accusing, they're usually the ones guilty.

00:03:09.290 --> 00:03:15.290
I believe they're floating it out there for
one of their own to assassinate Trump so that

00:03:15.290 --> 00:03:19.810
they can make a martyr out of him in hopes
to push their agenda further and also make

00:03:19.810 --> 00:03:21.280
the Democrats look terrible.

00:03:21.280 --> 00:03:22.280
What are your thoughts?

00:03:22.280 --> 00:03:23.280
Thanks.

00:03:23.280 --> 00:03:24.280
Love the show.

00:03:24.280 --> 00:03:25.280
Right.

00:03:25.280 --> 00:03:26.280
That's an interesting idea.

00:03:26.280 --> 00:03:27.280
And in fact, there could be two layers in.

00:03:27.280 --> 00:03:30.660
Let's just think about motive just because
