00:03:38.900 --> 00:03:45.780
You could say, hey, you know what's perfect,
let's get Trump killed, because then one,

00:03:45.780 --> 00:03:48.260
we get him out of the way.

00:03:48.260 --> 00:03:51.610
And two, we can run on the left.

00:03:51.610 --> 00:03:52.620
Killed him.

00:03:52.620 --> 00:03:54.000
And it'll just be great for us.

00:03:54.000 --> 00:04:00.630
We can have a non-Trump candidate energized
by this alleged assassination of Trump, by

00:04:00.630 --> 00:04:02.780
the deep state or by the left or whatever.

00:04:02.780 --> 00:04:05.870
Certainly a beautiful, beautiful idea.

00:04:05.870 --> 00:04:10.160
I don't think that that is what they are planning
